 "name_en": "Chemical Compliance in the Value Chain (31J)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Chemical Compliance in the Value Chain (31J)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item manages the compliance marketability checks in sales order processes and during outbound delivery.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Any material included in a sales order or sales quotation which is defined as relevant for compliance must be verified if the selling into the country/region and for the customer is allowed. The result of the marketability check may block the follow up documents or initiate a request for the product steward ship department.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">If selling is only possible under restrictions, the internal sales representative can initiate an approval process. The product stewardship department processes the approval request and approves or rejects the selling.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The sales documents are also blocked if selling is not possible or has not yet been assessed. A request is created for the product stewardship department if the assessment for a country/region and customer has not yet been done.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform compliance marketability check</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Verify compliance information</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process request for approval</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create outbound delivery and execute compliance check</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Mitigate compliance risks with up-to-date information integrated into the value chain</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate compliance marketability checks in the selling processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Product steward specialists get informed about new markets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Go through approval process to validate restrictions for selling</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>价值链中的化学品合规性 (31J)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目管理销售订单流程和出库交货期间的合规性适销性检查。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果允许向国家/地区和客户销售，则必须验证销售订单或销售报价中包含的任何与合规性相关的物料。适销性检查的结果可能会冻结后续凭证，或者向产品管理部门发起请求。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果只能在限制下进行销售，内部销售代表可以启动审批流程。产品管理部门处理审批请求并批准或拒绝销售。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果无法进行销售或尚未评估，则也会冻结销售凭证。如果尚未对国家/地区和客户进行评估，则会为产品管理部门创建请求。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行合规性适销性检查</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">验证合规性信息</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理审批请求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建出库交货并执行合规性检查</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc8e8f18f3e1640c3a09a8e8e7554414c__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过将最新信息集成到价值链中，降低合规性风险</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在销售流程中集成合规性适销性检查</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">产品管理专家了解新市场</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过审批流程验证销售限制</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
